icial [6357d9e4c]\nv4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\n### System information\n\nReproducible in: v4.7.beta1.official [1c8cc9e7e] v4.6.3.rc1.official [6357d9e4c] v4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe output panel shows:\n>   ERROR: Invalid new child index: 2.\n\nWhen reparenting multiple nodes, and they are selected from the bottom, up.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f2d1bc2-de73-4f14-99ba-1cc0d026dbe8\n\nThe error index is one less than the number of selected nodes:\n- 3 selected nodes, ERROR: Invalid new child index: 2.\n- 4 selected nodes, ERROR: Invalid new child index: 3.\n- 5 selected nodes, ERROR: Invalid new child index: 4.\n\n\nThe same error message is mentioned in the following issue, but it doesn't mention reparenting nodes.\nInherited AcceptDialog with Children Scenes Give \"Invalid new child index\" Error #112389\n\n\n### There's no error when\n- there are less than 3 selected nodes\n- the nodes are selected from the top, down\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b9ec058-1b47-4481-8e31-b44731ec8818\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the project: [error-when-reparenting-bottom-up-selected-nodes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27603392/error-when-reparenting-bottom-up-selected-nodes.zip)\n- open the bottom panel: Output\n- in the scene panel:\n```\nNode2D\n  Node2D\n  Node2D2\n  Node2D3\n```\n- select the last child: Node2D3\n- hold shift and click on the first child: Node2D\n- right-click on any of the selected node\n- choose: Reparent to New Node...\n- a dialog opens: Create New Node\n- the default node is selected: Node\n- click on the dialog's bottom button: Create\nThe nodes are reparented as expected, but:\n\nIssue:\nThe Output panel shows:\n>   ERROR: Invalid new child index: 2.\nReparent to New Node\n\nExpected:\nNo error message.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[error-when-reparenting-bottom-up-selected-nodes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27603392/error-when-reparenting-bottom-up-selected-nodes.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119406/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}